FRONT: With (W) cast on 26 sts. Knit 2 rows Garter st. 3rd row:  (3 buttonholes) K2. Cast off 2 sts. (K8. Cast off 2 sts.) twice. K2. 4th row:  K2. Cast on 2 sts. (K8. Cast on 2 sts.) twice. K2. Knit 2 rows Garter st. Continue in Stocking st. casting on 6 sts. beginning every row to 122 sts. on needle. Continue even until work from beginning measures 10 ins. (
                     1½ yrs.—10½ ins.
                     )
                     (
