(
2 yrs.—11 ins.
)  ending with purl row.

2nd decreasing row:  K3. (K5. Sl. 1. K1. p.s.s.o. K7. K2tog. K5) twice. 3rd decreasing row:  K3. (K5. Sl. 1. K1. p.s.s.o. K5. K2tog. K5) twice. 4th decreasing row:  K3. (K5. Sl. 1. K1. p.s.s.o. K3. K2tog. K5) twice. 5th decreasing row:  K3. (K5. Sl. 1. K1. p.s.s.o. K1. K2tog. K5) twice. 6th decreasing row:  K3. (K5. Sl. 1. K2tog. p.s.s.o. K5) twice. 25 sts. on needle. Continue even in Stocking st. until work from beginning measures 8 ins. (
