1st row:  K24. *Slip next 2 sts. onto spare needle and place at back of work. Knit next 2 sts. Bring the 2 sts. forward and slip them back onto needle. Knit these 2 sts. (This will be termed "Twist" throughout). K4. Repeat from * twice. Twist. K24. 2nd row:  K1. Purl to last st. K1. 3rd row:  Knit. 4th row:  As 2nd row. Repeat these 4 rows until work from beginning measures approx. 7 ins. (
